| RISC3D test: TORCS's lighting on a textured plane, in six parts.
| Writes LitResults and LitPicture (PNG); the litlinux script writes
| LitLinuxResults and LitLinuxPicture (Linux's Mesa directly) to compare.
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.03 Error Install riscos-risc3d 0.18-1 first (see !ReadMe)
RMEnsure Linux3D 0.02 Error Install riscos-risc3d 0.18-1 first (see !ReadMe)
Run <Obey$Dir>.gl1test lit <Obey$Dir>.LitPicture/png { > <Obey$Dir>.LitResults }
SetType <Obey$Dir>.LitPicture/png PNG
SetType <Obey$Dir>.LitResults Text
Filer_Run <Obey$Dir>.LitResults
